{"4857730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Rifted Skies", "steam_appid": 4857730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4857730/extras/8f094b8161024aa3f25d4f59df729fc6.avif?t=1785353220\" width=614 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Scan the QR code and join our <strong>Discord community </strong>today!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a race against the Rift swallowing reality. Fall, return, push deeper. Welcome to The Rifted Skies, a VR roguelite built for <strong>speed and flow.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Parkour Without Motion Sickness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Rifted Skies, <strong>your body drives movement.</strong> Sprint by swinging your arms, jump by throwing them upward, leap across gaps, slide, glide and climb anything that looks like it can hold you. Feel every run and make your muscles ache, with minimal buttons and <strong>no motion sickness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4857730/extras/3a2fd4482535376a2f20e62a32c42901.poster.avif?t=1785353220\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4857730/extras/3a2fd4482535376a2f20e62a32c42901.webm?t=1785353220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4857730/extras/3a2fd4482535376a2f20e62a32c42901.mp4?t=1785353220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dodge, Deflect, Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is reactive and skill-based. <strong>Dodge, deflect, interrupt.</strong> Wield the bow or katana to send projectiles back or smash through your foes at full speed. Enemies grow tougher, fights faster, and every move matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4857730/extras/b576513d1702fcda4949ccd1d007c13b.poster.avif?t=1785353220\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4857730/extras/b576513d1702fcda4949ccd1d007c13b.webm?t=1785353220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4857730/extras/b576513d1702fcda4949ccd1d007c13b.mp4?t=1785353220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Run</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gems from ancient altars and shape your power with every pick. Some upgrades click together, others clash. Push your luck and craft a run that feels your own. With <strong>100+ run upgrades and permanent unlocks,</strong> including flight, grappling hook, and charged fist, <strong>no two runs feel the same.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4857730/extras/20ab951782b8cc9aebae29a429d71e59.poster.avif?t=1785353220\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4857730/extras/20ab951782b8cc9aebae29a429d71e59.webm?t=1785353220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4857730/extras/20ab951782b8cc9aebae29a429d71e59.mp4?t=1785353220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprint, leap, slide, and glide with minimum buttons and <strong>no motion sickness</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb anything you see.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, reactive combat</strong> where enemies chase and corner you, but always play fair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully diegetic interface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield distinct weapons for skill-based ranged and melee combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the Rift that grows more aggressive the deeper you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ upgrades</strong> and countless build combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 unique enemies, 3 bosses across 3 biomes.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a race against the Rift swallowing reality. Fall, return, push deeper. Welcome to The Rifted Skies, a VR roguelite built for <strong>speed and flow.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Parkour Without Motion Sickness</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Rifted Skies, <strong>your body drives movement.</strong> Sprint by swinging your arms, jump by throwing them upward, leap across gaps, slide, glide and climb anything that looks like it can hold you. Feel every run and make your muscles ache, with minimal buttons and <strong>no motion sickness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4857730/extras/3a2fd4482535376a2f20e62a32c42901.poster.avif?t=1785353220\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4857730/extras/3a2fd4482535376a2f20e62a32c42901.webm?t=1785353220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4857730/extras/3a2fd4482535376a2f20e62a32c42901.mp4?t=1785353220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dodge, Deflect, Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is reactive and skill-based. <strong>Dodge, deflect, interrupt.</strong> Wield the bow or katana to send projectiles back or smash through your foes at full speed. Enemies grow tougher, fights faster, and every move matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4857730/extras/b576513d1702fcda4949ccd1d007c13b.poster.avif?t=1785353220\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4857730/extras/b576513d1702fcda4949ccd1d007c13b.webm?t=1785353220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4857730/extras/b576513d1702fcda4949ccd1d007c13b.mp4?t=1785353220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Run</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gems from ancient altars and shape your power with every pick. Some upgrades click together, others clash. Push your luck and craft a run that feels your own. With <strong>100+ run upgrades and permanent unlocks,</strong> including flight, grappling hook, and charged fist, <strong>no two runs feel the same.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4857730/extras/20ab951782b8cc9aebae29a429d71e59.poster.avif?t=1785353220\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4857730/extras/20ab951782b8cc9aebae29a429d71e59.webm?t=1785353220\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4857730/extras/20ab951782b8cc9aebae29a429d71e59.mp4?t=1785353220\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sprint, leap, slide, and glide with minimum buttons and <strong>no motion sickness</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb anything you see.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, reactive combat</strong> where enemies chase and corner you, but always play fair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully diegetic interface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield distinct weapons for skill-based ranged and melee combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the Rift that grows more aggressive the deeper you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ upgrades</strong> and countless build combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 unique enemies, 3 bosses across 3 biomes.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "The Rifted Skies is an active VR roguelite set in a long-abandoned world. Play as a lone warrior returning home. Parkour and fight to outrun a deadly Rift. Unlock new powers and uncover - can your home ever be saved?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4857730/dead3a2fead7afd98f4037647cf1c19794087970/header.jpg?t=1785353220", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4857730/603cd9c51c69c23f573b3545b00248eb1d799eee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785353220", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4857730/603cd9c51c69c23f573b3545b00248eb1d799eee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785353220", "website": "https://theriftedskies.dreamvr.pro/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>